		</ProcessOutputs>
	</ProcessDescription>
<ProcessDescription wps:processVersion="1" storeSupported="true" statusSupported="false">
<ows:Identifier>MiraMon:Indexs:Param1:4</ows:Identifier>
<ows:Title>4. TVI</ows:Title>
<ows:Abstract><![CDATA[<b>(Transformed Vegetation Index):</b>Transform of the NDVI index that allows working without negative values.<br/><br/><img alt="Imatge no visible des de DOS" src="TVI.gif"/>]]>
</ows:Abstract>
