		<ows:Title>9. MSAVI1 </ows:Title>
		<ows:Abstract><![CDATA[<b>(Modified Soil Adjusted Vegetation Index - 1):</b>The adjustment factor L of SAVI index is not constant, but an inverse function of the vegetation cover. There have been proposed two solutions:<br/><br/><img alt="Imatge no visible des de DOS" src="MSAVI1.gif"/><br/><br/><img alt="Imatge no visible des de DOS" src="MSAVI1n.gif"/>]]></ows:Abstract>
