		<ows:Identifier>MiraMon:Indexs:Param1:15</ows:Identifier>
		<ows:Title>15. AVI</ows:Title>
		<ows:Abstract><![CDATA[<b>(Angular Vegetation Index):</b>The AVI (Plummer et al. 1994) was chosen for the ATSR-2 sensor, and aims to use the availability of the green channel to normalize the effects of soil types and the atmosphere while maintaining sensitivity to the properties of the vegetation. The index is based on a geometric concept of the angle defined between the green, red and near-infrared wavebands, which characterizes chlorophyllthe absorption<br/><br/><img alt="Imatge no visible des de DOS" src="AVI.gif"/><br/><br/>The<img alt="Imatge no visible des de DOS" src="Lambda.gif"/>ccorrespond to the centers of each of the wavebands.]]></ows:Abstract>
	<DataInputs>
			<Input minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
			<ows:Identifier>Option</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>option</ows:Title>
				<ows:Abstract>Angular Vegetation Index
</ows:Abstract>
			<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Param1" />
			<LiteralData>
				<ows:AllowedValues>
				<ows:Value>15</ows:Value>
			</ows:AllowedValues>
		</LiteralData>
			</Input>
			<Input minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
				<ows:Identifier>BandIR</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>Band IR</ows:Title>
				<ows:Abstract>Infrared band.</ows:Abstract>
			<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Param2" />
			<ComplexData>
				<Default>
					<Format>
						<MimeType>application/x-IMG</MimeType>
						<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
					</Format>
				</Default>
				<Supported>
					<Format>
						<MimeType>application/x-IMG</MimeType>
						<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
					</Format>
				</Supported>
			</ComplexData>
			</Input>		
			<Input minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
				<ows:Identifier>BandR</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>Band R</ows:Title>
				<ows:Abstract>Red band.
</ows:Abstract>
			<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Param3" />
			<ComplexData>
				<Default>
					<Format>
						<MimeType>application/x-IMG</MimeType>
						<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
					</Format>
				</Default>
				<Supported>
					<Format>
						<MimeType>application/x-IMG</MimeType>
						<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
					</Format>
				</Supported>
			</ComplexData>
			</Input>		
			<Input minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
					<ows:Identifier>BandG</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>Band Green</ows:Title>
				<ows:Abstract>Green band.
</ows:Abstract>
			<ows:Metadata xlink:title="Param4" />
			<ComplexData>
				<Default>
					<Format>
						<MimeType>application/x-IMG</MimeType>
						<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
					</Format>
				</Default>
				<Supported>
					<Format>
						<MimeType>application/x-IMG</MimeType>
						<Encoding>Binary</Encoding>
					</Format>
				</Supported>
			</ComplexData>
			</Input>				
		</DataInputs>
		<ProcessOutputs>	
			  <Output>
			<ows:Identifier>OutputFile</ows:Identifier>
				<ows:Title>Output File</ows:Title>
